Package: fftw-gnu15-mvapich2-ohpc
Architecture: any
Depends: ohpc-filesystem, gnu15-compilers-ohpc (>= 14.1.0), mvapich2-gnu15-ohpc, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: A Fast Fourier Transform library (gnu15 + mvapich2, OpenHPC)
 FFTW is a C subroutine library for computing the Discrete Fourier
 Transform (DFT) in one or more dimensions, of both real and complex
 data, and of arbitrary input size.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family and mvapich2 MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
